    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get that it hasn't passed yet but even just looking at the scale of what they're proposing... like, isn't there a huge risk to the labor market? if you're pulling that many people out of the workforce at once, wouldn't that naturally tank the GDP? i'm just trying to understand the actual economic risks that experts are worried about.",
